@startuml 004-ranking-review-class
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
title 004 順位計算與老師判錯 — 類別圖（specify 2026-11-24；plan 以此為藍圖）

package "core.ranking_review（純函式）" {
  class Candidate <<frozen>> {
    question_number: int
    group_number: int
    answers: tuple[str, ...]
    received_at: datetime
    sequence: int
  }
  class JudgmentKey <<frozen>> {
    round_number: int
    question_number: int
    group_number: int
  }
  class RankingInput <<frozen>> {
    round_number: int
    fair_mode: bool
    question_numbers: tuple[int, ...]
    baseline: Mapping[int, int]
    candidates: tuple[Candidate, ...]
    judged_wrong: frozenset[JudgmentKey]
  }
  enum CandidateStatus {
    WINNER
    MISSED
    JUDGED_WRONG
  }
  enum WinReason {
    EARLIER_SUBMISSION
    FEWER_SUCCESSES
    RECEIVE_SEQUENCE
  }
  class RankedEntry <<frozen>> {
    candidate: Candidate
    status: CandidateStatus
    rank: int | None
    successes_at_processing: int
  }
  class QuestionResult <<frozen>> {
    question_number: int
    entries: tuple[RankedEntry, ...]
    winner_group: int | None
    reason: WinReason | None
    no_winner: bool
  }
  class RoundResult <<frozen>> {
    round_number: int
    fair_mode: bool
    question_order: tuple[int, ...]
    questions: tuple[QuestionResult, ...]
    provisional_successes: Mapping[int, int]
    --
    solved_questions(): frozenset[int]
    success_increments(): Mapping[int, int]
  }
  class RankingRules {
    {static} question_order(candidates, question_numbers): tuple[int, ...]
    {static} compute(input: RankingInput): RoundResult
    {static} affected(before: RoundResult, after: RoundResult): frozenset[int]
  }
  RankingInput o-- "0..*" Candidate
  RankingInput o-- "0..*" JudgmentKey
  RoundResult o-- "1..*" QuestionResult
  QuestionResult o-- "0..*" RankedEntry
  RankedEntry --> CandidateStatus
  QuestionResult --> WinReason
  RankingRules ..> RankingInput
  RankingRules ..> RoundResult
}

package "app.ranking_review" {
  class RoundReview <<frozen>> {
    round_number: int
    judged_wrong: frozenset[JudgmentKey]
    result_version: int
    last_affected: frozenset[int]
    finalized: RoundResult | None
  }
  class JudgmentStore {
    get(code, round_number): RoundReview
    put(code, review): None
  }
  class RankingService {
    set_judgment(code, requester, round_number, question, group, wrong: bool): Outcome[RoundReview]
    confirm_finalize(code, requester, result_version: int): Outcome[RoundResult]
    result_for(code, round_number): RoundResult | None
    snapshot_extension(activity, viewer): Mapping[str, object]
  }
  interface FinalizedResultReader <<Protocol>> {
    finalized_result(code, round_number): RoundResult | None
    all_finalized(code): tuple[RoundResult, ...]
  }
  interface JudgmentSource <<Protocol>> {
    is_judged_wrong(code, round, question, group): bool
  }
  RankingService --> JudgmentStore
  RankingService ..> RankingRules
  RankingService ..|> FinalizedResultReader
  RankingService ..|> JudgmentSource
  JudgmentStore o-- RoundReview
}

package "001 app.activity" {
  class ActivityService {
    current_round(code): Round | None
    finalize(code, requester, outcome: FinalizeOutcome): Outcome[int]
    add_snapshot_extension(ext): None
  }
  class FinalizeOutcome <<frozen>> {
    solved_questions: frozenset[int]
    success_increments: Mapping[int, int]
  }
  class Round <<frozen>> {
    number: int
    rules: RoundRules
    baseline: Mapping[int, int]
    closed: bool
  }
}

package "003 app.round_submission" {
  interface SubmissionReader <<Protocol>> {
    round_submissions(code, round_number): tuple[Submission, ...]
  }
}

RankingService --> ActivityService : 規則、基準、定案、快照擴充
RankingService --> SubmissionReader : 本輪提交（唯讀）
RankingService ..> FinalizeOutcome : 由 RoundResult 產生
ActivityService ..> Round

note right of RankingRules
  速度模式：未被判錯候選依（接收時間, 接收序號）排序。
  公平模式：依固定題序逐題，依（目前成功次數, 接收時間,
  接收序號）排序；勝者暫算次數 +1 後才處理下一題（Q-24）。
  題序：每題最早已接受提交的（時間, 序號），無提交題置後依題號。
  不讀時鐘、不讀全域狀態：相同輸入 → 相同結果。
end note
@enduml
